cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  IoT PM mining calibration: a Python pipeline for low-cost particulate-matter
  sensor calibration with a JCGM-101 uncertainty budget
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the associated article (see
  preferred-citation).
type: software
authors:
